---
description: >-
  Edge labels as tags (D626–D629): a plain label, a Markdown label of two lines
  (usecase keeps a plain `<br/>` as text), a label on a relationship with a
  `style` stroke, one on a wide relationship and the dashed include and extend
  labels. Each box is rounded, bordered 1 px solid in its line's colour (the
  styled one in pink, the wide and dashed ones still 1 px and solid), and
  filled with the theme background.
---
usecase-beta
  direction LR
  actor Customer
  actor Clerk
  Browse
  Checkout
  Payment
  Coupon
  Customer -- "plain" ---> Browse
  Customer -- "`first line
second line`" ---> Checkout
  Clerk styledEdge@-- "styled" ---> Checkout
  Clerk wideEdge@-- "wide" ---> Payment
  Checkout ..> : include Payment
  Coupon ..> : extend Checkout
  style styledEdge stroke:#d6336c
  style wideEdge stroke-width:4px
